insert into public.question_revision_locales (revision_id, locale, question, short_answer, explanation, code_example, common_mistakes, follow_up_questions, sources) select r.id, 'en', 'What should a React developer know about React Usetransition Concurrency Performance 003?', 'This question checks the core React Usetransition Concurrency Performance 003 concept and how to use it safely in React, modern hooks, and frontend architecture.', 'Explain React Usetransition Concurrency Performance 003 with its trade-offs, practical use cases, and the boundaries that keep the implementation maintainable.', 'function TabContainer() {
